e a  very good feeling towards american  express it's a kind of a luxury credit  card brand it's used by  business people it has uh i think really  good uh  brand perception or reputation  and the goal of the the un american  express campaign is really to challenge  that idea so american express for  example has now actually  given bonuses  to hiring managers  for  so-called racial equity meaning that  they are giving bonuses to hiring  managers  who hire more blacks  and fire white americans  so you hire black americans you fire  white americans for the sake of equity  you get a bonus you get a financial  incentive to be racist basically to  discriminate on the basis of race i mean  that is something that we opposed
 

